                                                "sense_id": "ae19663e-0fd3-3a86-93e7-5c917a56aed8",
                                                "text": "The yellow fog that rubs its back upon the window-panes, / The yellow smoke that rubs its muzzle on the window-panes, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a41aaede-e66f-3bd0-8d3c-a571ba4b9dc8",
